# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$
- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public String maxSumOfSquares(int num, int sum) {
        if (sum > num * 9) {
            return "";
        }

        StringBuilder res = new StringBuilder(num);

        while (num-- > 0) {
            int digit = Math.min(9, sum);
            res.append(digit);
            sum -= digit;
        }

        return (sum == 0) ? res.toString() : "";
    }
}
```
